cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Keel, cite it with this metadata.
title: Keel
abstract: >-
  An open academic programme for the development and operation of systems.
  A learner reads, checks, labs, and files a capstone across a twelve-week
  term. Accounts and progress can be kept in PostgreSQL. A written assessment
  is reviewed and then discarded; the record keeps a hash and flags.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Frank Asante Van Laarhoven
repository-code: https://github.com/FrankAsanteVanLaarhoven/Keel
url: https://keelai-os.vercel.app
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-29
keywords:
  - education
  - systems
  - devops
  - learning
